# Pre-existing Python-era tree -- out of scope for the new TS monorepo's format gate.
# NOTE: these must be root-anchored (leading `/`) -- an unanchored `src/` matches every
# package's own `src/` directory too (e.g. packages/schema/src/), not just this one, which
# silently made `pnpm format`/`format:write` a no-op for all TypeScript source from Phase 1
# through Phase 6b before this was caught. See docs/typescript-rewrite.md's phase history.
docs/*.md
!docs/typescript-rewrite.md
docs/investigations/
/examples/
/scripts/
/src/
/tests/
/vendor/
contracts/pixel_index/
pnpm-lock.yaml

